    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "40333851",
    "<h3><strong>可移动的储物家具</strong></h3>\n<p>坚固结实的三层手推车，可以将它放在房间中，当作你的文件&ldquo;中转站&rdquo;。你可以随时改变办公空间，无论坐在哪里办公，手推车均可承载重物跟上你。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/28/31/2831ec5f803a31043e91ee5370195639.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/28/31/2831ec5f803a31043e91ee5370195639.jpg",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "/p/40333851?artType=ART",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "af0dbbc7daa0406cb8ee9d4f29443882"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "60407365",
    "<h3><strong>轻松搬运</strong></h3>\n<p>想要一次性从储物柜里拿很多东西？光靠双手很吃力！一辆小推车就像及时雨，避免让你来回搬运。这款手推车适用于狭小的空间，可随心推到任何你需要的地方。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c5/5a/c55a8d6aacba598fe73510ef98ba756e.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/3b/9b/3b9b985e2b02d299f4b237ebc31aebf1.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
